        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As part of Celestica's ODM offerings, we design and manufacture products, either as customized solutions, white box solutions or under Joint Design and Manufacturing (JDM) engagements in collaboration with our customers.",
        "start_character": 8155,
        "end_character": 8375
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001030894-26-000011",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001030894-26-000011-523084e43b7a0e5d",
        "accession_number": "0001030894-26-000011",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "However, unlike our HPS business within our CCS segment, we do not generally collaborate with ATS customers on the design of the solutions we manufacture, or engage in R&D and product development for our own proprietary portfolio of solutions.",
        "start_character": 6802,
        "end_character": 7045
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001030894-26-000011",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001030894-26-000011-523084e43b7a0e5d",
        "accession_number": "0001030894-26-000011",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In 1993, we began providing electronics manufacturing services to non-IBM customers.",
        "start_character": 770,
        "end_character": 854
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001030894-26-000011",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001030894-26-000011-523084e43b7a0e5d",
        "accession_number": "0001030894-26-000011",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Information regarding material effects of government regulations on our business is provided in Item 1A, Risk Factors, under \"We are subject to the risk of increasing income and other taxes, tax audits and the challenges of successfully defending our tax positions, and obtaining, renewing or meeting the conditions of tax incentives and credits, any of which may adversely affect our financial performance,\" \"Compliance or the failure to comply with governmental laws, regulations, and obligations could be costly and may negatively impact our financial performance,\" \"Compliance or the failure to comply with employment laws and regulations may negatively impact our financial performance,\" \"U.S.",
        "start_character": 45082,
        "end_character": 45780
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001030894-26-000011",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001030894-26-000011-523084e43b7a0e5d",
        "accession_number": "0001030894-26-000011",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Prior to our incorporation, we were an IBM manufacturing unit that provided manufacturing services to IBM for more than 75 years.",
        "start_character": 640,
        "end_character": 769
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001030894-26-000011",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001030894-26-000011-523084e43b7a0e5d",
        "accession_number": "0001030894-26-000011",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "The products we manufacture and assemble may be used directly by our customers in their own data centers, as in the case of hyperscalers or enterprise customers, or may be re-sold to end users by our OEM customers.",
        "start_character": 17977,
        "end_character": 18191
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001030894-26-000011",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001030894-26-000011-523084e43b7a0e5d",
        "accession_number": "0001030894-26-000011",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "To remain competitive, we believe we must continue to provide advanced manufacturing services and solutions, lead design capabilities in the technologies we support in our HPS business, maintain high quality levels, deliver finished products and services on time and compete favorably on price.",
        "start_character": 40571,
        "end_character": 40865
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001030894-26-000011",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001030894-26-000011-523084e43b7a0e5d",
        "accession_number": "0001030894-26-000011",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also license certain technology from third parties that we use in providing electronics manufacturing services to our customers.",
        "start_character": 37808,
        "end_character": 37939
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001030894-26-000011",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001030894-26-000011-523084e43b7a0e5d",
        "accession_number": "0001030894-26-000011",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also seek to provide value to our customers through our after-market services offerings which include repair, fulfillment, reverse logistics, ITAM/ITAD, reclamation and returns processing and prevention.",
        "start_character": 25777,
        "end_character": 25983
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001030894-26-000011",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001030894-26-000011-523084e43b7a0e5d",
        "accession_number": "0001030894-26-000011",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are a corporation domiciled in the Province of Ontario, Canada and operate under the Business Corporations Act (Ontario) (OBCA).",
        "start_character": 91,
        "end_character": 222
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001030894-26-000011",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001030894-26-000011-523084e43b7a0e5d",
        "accession_number": "0001030894-26-000011",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are proactive in developing manufacturing techniques that take advantage of the latest component, product and packaging designs.",
        "start_character": 34492,
        "end_character": 34623
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001030894-26-000011",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001030894-26-000011-523084e43b7a0e5d",
        "accession_number": "0001030894-26-000011",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe our competitive advantage is our track record in advanced manufacturing capabilities, design and engineering, quality, delivery, managing complexity and responsiveness enabling cost-effective solutions and speed-to-market, as well as value-added services, including engineering and supply chain services.",
